# Verifiers for signatures this project publishes.
#
# One identity, and it is not the repository authority. Publishing a binary is
# not a scientific Decision, so a release manifest and a Decision must never be
# checkable against the same key: see docs/SIGNING.md.
#
# `namespaces=` scopes the key to release manifests. Without it this line would
# accept a signature this identity made over anything at all, which is a wider
# claim than the one it exists to support.
#
#   ssh-keygen -Y verify -f allowed_signers -I release@vela.space \
#     -n vela-release -s release-manifest.json.sig < release-manifest.json
release@vela.space namespaces="vela-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIDZ+fwqljQBzprznZmeAY3KwHVrKOaW+/z5GflVwilG5 Vela release distribution
